  (descr "noknok PicoHub mezzanine contact pads, interface rev 2 (22 Sep 2026): 24 flat round pads D2.4 mm in four clusters (A 2x3, D 2x3, B 2x4, C 2x2), 3.5 mm pitch, copper + mask only (NO paste, ENIG) - the spring pins live on the mezzanine. Origin = mounting hole H1 (3,3 on the 60x40 MOD-0008 pattern): place on the BOTTOM at H1, rotation 0; authored with y negated so the flip puts every pad at its viewed-from-above position. Pad numbers <cluster><n>, see the noknok_Mezzanine_4Cluster symbol.")
